  "Description": "Repeats the incoming field a limited number of times along one axis.\n\nIt needs an incoming field like [BoxSDF] or [TorusSDF]. Render the result with [RaymarchField] and inspect it with [VisualizeFieldDistance].\n\nSee also: [RepeatAxis], [RepeatField3]",
